       "text": "No casualties were reported in the first hours after the damage was reported.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "The Sorrel Basin Water Authority began issuing information on the dam's condition as the response got under way.",
